    "游戏、工具和制作记录。选择项目查看源码与进展。": "Games, tools, and making-of notes. Choose a project to explore its source and progress.",
    "选择一项任务，查看验收要求后到仓库讨论。待验收表示仍需核对，不等于已发布。": "Choose a task, read its acceptance criteria, and discuss it in the repository. Awaiting review does not mean released.",
    "不必先掌握整个项目。先选择感兴趣的作品，把一次体验、一个问题或一条清楚的建议带回来。": "You do not need to understand the whole project first. Pick a work that interests you and share an experience, an issue, or a clear suggestion.",
    "下载源码，运行项目，再选择一个明确的改动。": "Download the source, run the project, and choose a focused change.",
    "还没有公开的更新记录。计划确认后会在这里说明。": "No public updates yet. Confirmed plans will appear here.",
    "这条记录尚未公开。": "This record is not public yet.",
    "已发布的试玩在独立页面运行；操作方式、声音设置和素材说明见游戏内菜单。": "The released game runs on its own page. See the in-game menus for controls, audio settings, and asset notices.",
    "语言与字体由共享模块处理；新增内容先登记译文，再生成页面并检查缺字与回退。": "Shared modules handle language and typography. Register translations for new content, then build and check glyph coverage and fallbacks.",
    "日常修改统一运行 npm run platform:verify。它依次生成内容与页面，汇总源代码检查和测试，再核对发布产物；任何失败都不会被当成发布通过。": "Run npm run platform:verify for routine changes. It generates content and pages, collects source checks and tests, and then verifies the publication artifact. A failed step is never treated as release approval.",
    "新实验登记在 content/experiments/catalog.json。复制一份记录，填写原始提示词、模型和产物校验值；页面、目录与下载入口由同一登记生成。": "Register new experiments in content/experiments/catalog.json. Create a record with the original prompt, model, and artifact checksum. That registration generates its page, directory entry, and download links.",
    "更新包由明确的基线和文件差异生成。只携带本次修改，检查文件冲突、原始作品校验值和发布结果，不覆盖其他人的新提交。": "Update packages are generated from an explicit baseline and file differences. They carry only the intended changes, check conflicts and original artifacts, and never overwrite someone else's new commits.",
    "运行、构建、校验和打包的入口由 config/site-platform.json 统一登记。旧命令继续有效；模块职责和生成文件归属见源码中的 docs/platform/。": "config/site-platform.json registers the common build, verification, and packaging workflow. Existing commands remain available. See docs/platform/ in the source for module responsibilities and generated-file ownership.",
    "文档原文为中文。": "This document is available in Chinese.",
    "部分历史记录保留中文原文。": "Some historical records retain their original Chinese text.",
