    "IN THE MAKING / 实验": "IN THE MAKING / EXPERIMENTS",
    "建议使用桌面浏览器；可用键鼠或手柄游玩。": "A desktop browser is recommended. Play with a keyboard and mouse or a gamepad.",
    "在浏览器中打开，按游戏内提示开始。": "Open in your browser and follow the in-game instructions.",
    "预览图暂时无法显示，仍可开始试玩。": "The preview image is unavailable. You can still start the game.",
    "这里打开已发布的试玩页。开发源码与实验功能在“开发”栏目中单独说明。": "This opens the released game. Development source and experimental features are documented separately in Dev.",
    "操作与常见问题": "Controls and common questions",
    "按键说明、声音和暂停选项请查看游戏内菜单。浏览器未播放声音时，先与游戏页面交互，再检查音量；也可以先静音体验。": "See the in-game menu for controls, sound, and pause options. If there is no audio, interact with the game first, then check the volume. You can also play muted.",
    "下载后解压，再打开其中的 index.html。浏览器游戏与可下载文件的可用内容，以该版本说明为准。": "Extract the download, then open index.html. Refer to the version notes for the content available in the browser and downloadable editions.",
    "浏览器游戏与可下载文件的可用内容，以该版本说明为准。": "Refer to the version notes for the content available in the browser and downloadable editions.",
    "查看试玩帮助": "Read the play guide",
    "体验作品、查看源码，遇到问题也有去处。": "Try the projects, explore the source, and find help when needed.",
    "第一次来，从游戏列表选择一款作品，点击“开始试玩”即可。想看制作过程，再进入开发资料。": "Start by choosing a game and selecting Play now. Visit the development resources to learn how it was made.",
    "先体验作品": "Try a project first",
    "查看游戏封面和简介，选择一款开始。操作方式和支持的设备以游戏内说明为准。": "Browse the covers and descriptions, then choose a game. Check the in-game instructions for controls and supported devices.",
    "看看如何制作": "See how it is made",
    "开发栏目提供源码、运行方法和可参与的任务。待验收的开发版与已发布的试玩版分开标注。": "Dev contains source code, setup instructions, and tasks to contribute to. Development candidates awaiting review are labeled separately from released games.",
    "声音没有播放": "No sound?",
    "先点击游戏的开始或声音按钮，再检查浏览器标签页和系统音量。音频仍未就绪时，可以先静音试玩；具体加载与重试方式见游戏内设置。": "Select the game's start or sound button, then check the browser tab and system volume. You can play muted while audio loads. See the in-game settings for loading and retry options.",
    "键盘、手柄与手机": "Keyboard, gamepad, and mobile",
    "先让游戏获得焦点，再按当前显示的按键操作。手柄、触屏和改键支持因作品而异；手机上的操作支持请看各作品说明；没有触屏按钮时，请在电脑上体验。": "Focus the game, then use the controls shown. Gamepad, touch, and remapping support vary by project. Check each project's mobile guidance; use a computer when touch controls are not provided.",
    "页面或素材没有加载": "A page or asset did not load",
    "检查网络后重试。返回作品介绍页可以确认版本和下载入口。不要为恢复加载而先删除存档或重置全部浏览器数据。": "Check your connection and retry. The project page lists its version and downloads. Do not delete saves or reset all browser data as a first troubleshooting step.",
    "反馈一个问题": "Report a problem",
    "记录作品名称、版本、浏览器、输入设备与复现步骤。在相应项目的任务或参与页面提交反馈；避免附带密码、个人存档等敏感信息。": "Include the project, version, browser, input device, and steps to reproduce the issue. Use the project's Tasks or Contribute page. Do not include passwords, personal saves, or other sensitive information.",
    "选择项目并反馈": "Choose a project to report an issue",
