    "开发源码 0.4.3。下载、运行与参与开发。": "Development source 0.4.3. Download, run, and contribute.",
    "这是 0.4.3 开发候选，和已发布试玩分别维护；完整设备与自然通关验收尚未完成。": "This is the 0.4.3 development candidate, maintained separately from the released game. Full device testing and natural playthrough review are not complete.",
    "地图工具 W02 使用独立的 M06 运行时，完整角色尚不能直接用于任意地图。第四期试玩与源码另有入口。": "Map tools W02 use a separate M06 runtime. Full characters cannot yet be used directly on arbitrary maps. Episode 4 has separate game and source entries.",
    "源码包保留贡献指南、模块说明、测试和版本记录。": "The source package includes contribution guidance, module documentation, tests, and version history.",
    "历史版本的开发资料。": "Development documentation for a historical version.",
    "本文对应标题中标注的版本；当前源码和适用范围请查看项目资料。": "This document applies to the version in its title. See the project resources for current source code and scope.",
