    "可试玩": "Playable",
    "Contra · 比尔 / 洛克人": "Contra · Bill / Mega Man",
    "不同武器与射击方式，闯过熟悉的地上关卡。": "Use different weapons and firing styles to cross the familiar overworld stage.",
    "忍者龙剑传 / 坦克大战": "Ninja Gaiden / Battle City",
    "32 张底图，下一关由你来定义。": "32 base maps. Shape the next stage.",
    "每关提供地形、对象定位、区域关系与开发清单。先选地图，再设计合适的角色能力。": "Each stage includes terrain, object positions, area connections, and a development checklist. Choose a map, then design suitable character abilities.",
    "下载全世界开发包": "Download the all-worlds development kit",
    "打开地图册": "Open the atlas",
    "查看使用说明": "Read the guide",
    "63 个参考区域 · 33 个循环路线分段。模板已整理不代表 32 关游戏已完成；水下与循环机关仍需驱动，模板采用社区参考，不是官方导出；原版独立核验与自然通关仍待完成。": "63 reference areas · 33 loop-route sections. Organized templates do not mean all 32 stages are finished games. Underwater and looping mechanics still need drivers. Templates use community references, not official exports; independent fidelity review and natural playthroughs are still pending.",
    "开发资料重新分类，加入实验室": "Reorganized development resources and added the lab",
    "按入门、内容维护、发布与参考组织网站资料；减少开发页首次切换的加载依赖。实验室收录鹈鹕骑行动画、原始提示词与模型信息。": "Website resources are organized into getting started, content maintenance, publishing, and references, with fewer loading dependencies on the first Dev visit. The lab includes the cycling pelican, its original prompt, and model information.",
    "欢迎反馈链接、阅读和移动端体验问题。较大的结构或视觉调整，请先在 Issue 中说明目标与方案。": "Reports about links, readability, and the mobile experience are welcome. Discuss the goals and approach in an issue before major structural or visual changes.",
    "浏览项目进展、阅读开发资料，或在实验室查看提示词与实际作品。": "Browse project progress, read development resources, or compare prompts and actual results in the lab.",
    "第四期索尼克与奥日独立试玩已上线": "Episode 4: Sonic and Ori is available as a standalone game",
    "补齐第四期介绍、试玩和关卡进度入口。四期独立游戏与 M07 待验收开发候选分别维护，视频状态见当前视频入口。": "Added Episode 4 introduction, game, and stage-progress entries. The four standalone games are maintained separately from the M07 development candidate awaiting review. See the current video entries for video status.",
    "第四期 R43 最终源码独立整理": "Organized Episode 4 R43 source separately",
    "为已发布的索尼克与奥日第四期增加独立源码目录、源码下载与启动说明。样式、运行时代码和内嵌素材分离维护，可无损还原 R43 发布 HTML；原有四期试玩、第三期 M07 与视频链接保持独立。": "Added a separate source directory, download, and setup guide for the released Sonic and Ori episode. Styles, runtime code, and embedded assets are maintained separately and rebuild the exact R43 release HTML. The four games, Episode 3 M07, and video links remain independent.",
    "地图工坊测试版源码已合入主分支": "Map Workshop beta source merged into main",
    "支持从 32 关参考底图创建、编辑与保存工程，马里奥试玩、外接手柄和单关/连续版离线导出。相关实现已合入主分支；隐藏路线与复杂机关继续核验。魂斗罗角色迁移暂不开放。": "Create, edit, and save projects from 32 reference maps, playtest with Mario and a gamepad, and export offline single-stage or campaign games. The implementation is in main; hidden routes and complex mechanics remain under review. Contra character migration is not yet open.",
    "开发栏目支持多个项目": "Dev supports multiple projects",
    "各项目分别提供概览、任务、资料与更新入口。": "Each project has its own overview, tasks, resources, and updates.",
    "设备验收": "Device testing",
    "真实手柄改键、断连与返回游戏": "Physical gamepad remapping, disconnects, and returning to the game",
    "检查手柄改键、断连、热插拔和返回游戏。复验放置是否位于脚边前一格，并记录坐骑奖励、姿势与武器位置。": "Check gamepad remapping, disconnects, hot-plugging, and returning to the game. Recheck placement one cell ahead of the feet, and record mount rewards, poses, and weapon positions.",
    "记录设备型号与浏览器": "Record the device model and browser",
    "连续开关菜单无误触": "Repeated menu opening and closing causes no unintended inputs",
    "映射保存后刷新可恢复": "Saved mappings are restored after reload",
    "体验": "Experience",
    "完整仓库的导航与真实转场验收": "Full-repository navigation and transition testing",
    "从首页进入两个项目及其子页，再前进、后退、刷新。": "Visit two projects and their subpages from Home, then test forward, back, and reload.",
    "只有六项顶栏且开发日志高亮正确": "Exactly six navigation items, with Dev highlighted correctly",
    "所有子页使用同一个原生转场": "All subpages use the same native transition",
