    "48 秒原生 WebGL 动画，附最终成片与可直接播放的 HTML。": "A 48-second native WebGL animation, with the final film and a directly playable HTML edition.",
    "月夜骑行音乐动画。制作工程包含编舞、角色动作、自行车与命中音效代码；HTML 为原生 JavaScript / WebGL 动画。": "A moonlit cycling music animation. The production source includes choreography, character motion, bicycle animation and impact audio; the HTML is a native JavaScript / WebGL animation.",
