    "以中秋文化为主题，保留完整画面与中文字幕，配乐为《彩云追月》。HTML 可直接播放最终成片，制作工程包含绘制源码与配乐合成脚本。": "A film about Mid-Autumn culture with Chinese captions and the Cai Yun Zhui Yue soundtrack. The HTML plays the final film; the production source includes drawing code and a soundtrack assembly script.",
    "提供彩云追月版 HTML、1080p 成片、时间轴、字幕与配乐合成工程；B 站视频通过原 BV 号观看。": "Includes the Cai Yun Zhui Yue HTML edition, the 1080p film, timeline, captions and soundtrack assembly source. The Bilibili video is available through its original BV ID.",
    "当世界执行了我｜world.execute(me);": "When the World Executes Me | world.execute(me);",
    "如果一段程序学会了爱，它能等到一次真正的回应吗？用电路、字符画与几何变换，重新想象 Mili 的音乐世界。": "If a program learned to love, would it ever receive a real response? Circuits, ASCII art and geometric transformations reimagine the musical world of Mili.",
    "程序动画 MV": "Programmed animation MV",
    "AC to DC：左侧交流波形、中央整流桥与右侧逐渐平滑的直流波形": "AC to DC: an AC waveform on the left, a bridge rectifier in the center, and a progressively smoother DC waveform on the right",
    "电流从交流变成直流，NE555 的脉冲不停跳动；P2 离开了，调用栈却还在增长。献给写过代码、画过电路，也曾在游戏里等过另一个人的你。": "Alternating current becomes direct current, and the NE555 keeps pulsing. P2 has left, but the call stack keeps growing. For anyone who has written code, drawn circuits, or waited for someone in a game.",
    "《world.execute(me);》程序动画 MV 已发布": "world.execute(me); programmed animation MV is out",
    "在哔哩哔哩观看完整 MV：整流桥把交流变成直流，NE555 持续跳动，字符与几何共同讲述一段没有返回的调用。": "Watch the full MV on Bilibili: a bridge rectifier turns AC into DC, the NE555 keeps pulsing, and characters and geometry tell the story of a call that never returns.",
