    "Bad Apple!!｜光织放映室": "Bad Apple!! | Light Loom Cinema",
    "让光束、微镜与琴键一起演奏 Bad Apple!!。从黑白影绘到彩色与 MMD，在一间不断进化的放映室里重温这首歌。": "Light beams, micromirrors and piano keys perform Bad Apple!! together. Revisit the song in an evolving cinema, from black-and-white silhouettes to color and MMD.",
    "竖屏音乐 MV": "Portrait music video",
    "黑白影绘投在幕布上，光束经过透镜与微镜阵列，下方琴键随音乐亮起。": "Black-and-white silhouettes fill a projection screen above lenses, a micromirror array and piano keys that light up with the music.",
    "横向放映室实景：黑白影绘投在幕布上，光束经过透镜与微镜阵列，下方琴键随音乐亮起。": "A landscape view of the running cinema: black-and-white silhouettes on the screen, light passing through lenses and a micromirror array, and piano keys responding to the music.",
    "观看视频 · 待发布": "Watch video · Coming soon",
    "完整视频将在哔哩哔哩发布，链接待补充。": "The full video will be available on Bilibili; the link is pending.",
    "待发布": "Coming soon",
    "Bad Apple!!：光织放映室 MV 已发布": "Bad Apple!!: Light Loom Cinema MV released",
    "在哔哩哔哩观看完整竖屏 MV：从黑白影绘到彩色与 MMD，光束、微镜与琴键共同演绎 Bad Apple!!。交互 HTML 与制作源码同步提供。": "Watch the full portrait MV on Bilibili: from black-and-white silhouettes to color and MMD, light beams, micromirrors and piano keys perform Bad Apple!! together. The interactive HTML and production source are also available.",
    "打开 HTML，可以暂停、调节视角，观察放映室里的光路与微镜；完整 MV 的阶段字幕、声音交接与竖屏片尾请在哔哩哔哩观看。制作源码附有运行说明和素材清单。原曲：Bad Apple!! feat. nomico / Alstroemeria Records；影绘原作：sm8628149。策划、审校：在下_小Q；视觉、程序与剪辑：GPT-6 · Codex。字体：思源黑体、霞鹜文楷。本片为非官方同人 MV，含 AI 辅助制作内容。音乐、角色及影像权益归相应权利人。": "Open the HTML to pause, adjust the view, and explore the light paths and micromirrors. Watch the full MV on Bilibili for the stage captions, audio handover and portrait outro. The source archive includes running instructions and a media list. Music: Bad Apple!! feat. nomico / Alstroemeria Records. Original silhouette animation: sm8628149. Concept and review: Xiao Q. Visuals, programming and editing: GPT-6 / Codex. Fonts: Source Han Sans and LXGW WenKai. This unofficial fan MV includes AI-assisted production. Music, characters and footage belong to their respective rights holders.",
    "同一首 Bad Apple!!，从合成音色走向原声，从黑白影绘走向灰度、彩色与 MMD。光束穿过放映装置，微镜阵列与琴键随音乐变化。画面里的光学结构是一种艺术化的数值演示。": "One song evolves from synthesized sound to the original recording, and from black-and-white silhouettes to grayscale, color and MMD. Light passes through the projection system while micromirrors and piano keys respond to the music. The optical structure is an artistic numerical demonstration.",
    "影像素材：": "Footage sources: ",
    "黑白影绘": "Black-and-white silhouettes",
    "彩色重绘（含灰度阶段）": "Color animation (also used for grayscale)",
    "MMD 动画": "MMD animation",
    "HTML 提供交互动画体验；完整 MV 与经典侧边片尾请在哔哩哔哩观看。源码包包含动画程序、电路模型、字幕和制作脚本。 原曲：Mili《world.execute(me);》。策划、审校：在下_小Q；视觉、程序与剪辑：GPT-6 · Codex。本片为非官方同人 MV，含 AI 生成内容。音乐及歌词权益归相应权利人；电路采用简化模型，情感与角色变化属于艺术表达。": "The HTML offers an interactive animation. Watch the full MV and signature sidebar outro on Bilibili. The source archive includes animation code, circuit models, subtitles and production scripts. Music: Mili, world.execute(me);. Concept and review: Xiao Q. Visuals, programming and editing: GPT-6 / Codex. This unofficial fan MV includes AI-generated content. Music and lyrics belong to their respective rights holders. The circuits use simplified models; emotions and character changes are artistic interpretations.",
