    "米白：地形 · 金色：平台 · 粉色：待实现对象。循环段以本段起点计坐标，不是拼接完成的通关路线。": "Ivory: terrain · Gold: platforms · Pink: unimplemented objects. Loop-segment coordinates start at that segment’s origin; they are not a fully connected completion route.",
