    "选一项，在仓库 Issue 里写明任务编号、计划文件、验收方式，等维护者确认范围再做大改。文档错字或小测试可以直接提交。": "choose one and describe the task ID, planned files and acceptance checks in a repository Issue. Wait for scope confirmation before major changes. Documentation corrections and small tests can go directly into a PR.",
    "审核通过后再合并。源码测试不是发布批准，发布须完成对应版本的验收和批准；": "Merge after review. Source tests are not release approval; complete acceptance and approval for the relevant version. Refer to the",
    "可供参考。任务认领、审核和合并结果以对应的 GitHub 记录为准。新提交者拿不到主仓库发布权限。": "for historical guidance. GitHub records determine task assignments, reviews and merge results. New contributors receive no main-repository publication permission.",
    "先把项目跑起来，再深入实现与设计。": "Run the project first, then explore implementation and design.",
    "完成网站验收后，记录实际提交号、部署结果与线上地址。": "After website acceptance, record the actual commit, deployment result and online URL.",
    "维护可重复运行的回归检查，并在完整网站中扩大覆盖。": "Maintain repeatable regression checks and expand coverage on the complete website.",
    "SITE-001 · 待处理；SITE-002 · 待处理": "SITE-001 · Ready; SITE-002 · Ready",
    "安全问题私下反馈": "Report security issues privately",
    "涉及密钥泄露、任意代码执行、用户数据或发布权限的问题，请通过 hfutqdm@163.com 私下联系维护者。不要在公开 Issue、PR 或讨论中发布可利用细节、令牌或私人数据；普通玩法问题、功能建议或文档错误使用 Issue 模板。": "For exposed credentials, arbitrary code execution, user data exposure or unauthorized publishing access, contact the maintainer privately at hfutqdm@163.com. Do not post exploitable details, tokens or private data in public Issues, PRs or discussions. Use Issue templates for ordinary gameplay problems, feature requests or documentation errors.",
    "运行外部贡献代码前，先审阅代码、工作流与构建脚本。低权限 CI 检查通过不代表代码可信；未经审阅的代码不得在持有部署密钥或写权限的环境中执行，也不要在个人电脑上直接运行不理解的脚本。": "Before running external contributions, review the code, workflows and build scripts. Passing CI with limited permissions does not establish that code is trustworthy. Do not execute unreviewed code in an environment with deployment credentials or write access, or run unfamiliar scripts directly on your personal computer.",
    "安全反馈指南 · 中文": "Security reporting guide · Chinese",
    "安全反馈指南 · English": "Security reporting guide · English",
    "仿真示波器音乐播放器": "Simulated Oscilloscope Music Player",
    "导入自己的音乐或视频，在四通道示波器上查看 XY、频谱、包络与 PWM，调节旋钮并导出画面。播放器在电脑本机运行。": "Import your own music or video, explore XY traces, a spectrum, an envelope and PWM on four channels, adjust the knobs and export the result. The player runs locally on your computer.",
    "四通道示波器整机：黄色人物 XY 轨迹、绿色频谱、蓝色包络与红色 PWM。": "A complete four-channel oscilloscope with a yellow XY figure, green spectrum, blue envelope and red PWM.",
    "本地播放器": "Local player",
    "使用与下载": "Use and download",
    "本地播放器与音乐演示": "Local player and music demonstration",
    "下载本地播放器与源码": "Download the local player and source",
    "把声音变成曲线，也把曲线变成声音。播放器支持音乐与视频导入、四通道独立显示、CH1–4、横纵轴旋钮、RUN/STOP、电源和 Auto 复位；可切换整机或屏幕取景。XY 实验支持函数和图片轮廓生成双声道 WAV，片段可导出为 MP4。": "Turn sound into curves, and curves into sound. Import music or video, view four separate channels, operate CH1–4, horizontal and vertical knobs, RUN/STOP, power and Auto reset, and switch between the complete instrument and screen views. XY Lab generates stereo WAV audio from functions or image outlines. Selected clips can be exported as MP4.",
    "本地播放器需 Python 3.12、FFmpeg 和支持 WebGL 2 的桌面浏览器；下载包内附说明，默认载入完整 Bad Apple，首次准备需要稍等。XY 实验可直接载入完整作品，包括 Primer；其他作品首次载入需要联网下载和本机准备，之后复用缓存。完整素材页同时提供手动下载入口，所选媒体在本机处理。外观参考 Keysight UXR，为独立软件仿真。配套演示片长 2 分 02.37 秒，采用节选，Keil → Primer → Bad Apple 为最后三段；配套演示视频已在 B 站发布。策划、制作：在下_小Q；程序仿真、视频剪辑：GPT-6 Astra · Codex。": "The local player requires Python 3.12, FFmpeg and a desktop WebGL 2 browser. Instructions are included. The complete Bad Apple video loads by default; first-time preparation takes a moment. XY Lab loads complete works, including Primer. The first load of other works needs an internet connection and local preparation; later loads reuse the cache. The materials page also offers manual downloads. Media is processed locally. The Keysight UXR appearance is an independent software simulation. The 2:02.37 demonstration uses excerpts and ends with Keil → Primer → Bad Apple; its demonstration video is available on Bilibili. Concept and production: 在下_小Q. Simulation and video editing: GPT-6 Astra · Codex.",
    "新增可下载的四通道本地播放器，支持音乐与视频导入、XY 声音实验及 MP4 导出；配套演示视频已发布。": "Added a downloadable four-channel local player with music and video import, XY sound experiments and MP4 export. The accompanying demonstration video is available on Bilibili.",
    "打开 仿真示波器音乐播放器": "Open the Simulated Oscilloscope Music Player",
