    "绘制地图，放置地形、敌人与奖励，边编辑边试玩。用 AI 辅助制图，保存工程并导出自己的关卡。": "Draw maps, place terrain, enemies and rewards, and test as you edit. Use AI to help create maps, save projects and export your own levels.",
