    "误入小小梦魇的厨房：引开厨师、躲进桌底、推箱开门，再与小六一起乘吊钩离开。": "Lost in a Little Nightmares kitchen: distract the chef, hide under tables, push a crate, then escape on a hook with Six.",
    "把马里奥的跳跃与《小小梦魇》的潜行氛围放进同一个 3D HTML 关卡。敲响锅盖引开厨师，利用桌底与箱子寻找出路，出口还有小六等候。本作是非官方同人关卡。": "Mario jumping meets the stealth atmosphere of Little Nightmares in a playable 3D HTML level. Distract the chef with a pot lid, find a way through tables and crates, and meet Six at the exit. This is an unofficial fan-made level.",
    "游戏制作：GPT-6.1 sol。策划、制作：在下_小Q；AI 辅助与视频剪辑：Codex。HTML 是可操作的 3D 游戏；约 44 秒的视频为通关剪辑，另含配乐与三连片尾，完整视频已在哔哩哔哩发布。配乐：Tobias Lilja《Little Nightmares》原声选段。片尾与封面字体：霞鹜文楷。角色、模型与原声音乐的权利归各自权利人所有。": "Game creation: GPT-6.1 sol. Planning and production: 在下_小Q; AI assistance and video editing: Codex. The HTML is a playable 3D game. The approximately 44-second walkthrough video adds music and an outro; the full video is available on Bilibili. Music: selections from the Little Nightmares soundtrack by Tobias Lilja. Cover and outro font: LXGW WenKai. Character, model and soundtrack rights belong to their respective owners.",
    "马里奥置身昏暗的三维厨房，封面标题为马里奥·午夜厨房。": "Mario in a dim 3D kitchen, with the cover title Homemade Mario 2 | Little Nightmares · Midnight Kitchen.",
    "3D 潜行游戏": "3D stealth game",
