    "下载游戏源码": "Download game source",
    "新增可玩的 3D 厨房潜行关卡与游戏源码；马里奥在出口遇见小六，两人一起随吊钩离开。完整视频已在哔哩哔哩发布。": "A playable 3D kitchen stealth level and its source code are available. Mario meets Six at the exit and they leave together on a hook. The full video is available on Bilibili.",
    "自制马里奥3 | Bad Apple!! 音乐小剧场": "Homemade Mario 3 | Bad Apple!! Music Theatre",
    "跟着 Bad Apple!! 的节拍跳跃、下蹲与发射火球，看金币和砖块把平面舞台展开成立体音乐剧。": "Jump, crouch and throw fireballs to the beat of Bad Apple!! as coins and blocks turn the flat stage into a 3D musical.",
    "把 Bad Apple!! 变成一整首可玩的马里奥音乐关。动作谱与音乐同步，经典角色、金币和砖块共同演绎舞台轮廓；后半段进入立体舞台。本作是非官方同人作品。": "Bad Apple!! becomes a full-length playable Mario rhythm course. Action cues follow the music while classic characters, coins and blocks form the performance silhouettes. The later section unfolds into a 3D stage. This is an unofficial fan project.",
    "策划、制作：在下_小Q。游戏制作：GPT-6.1 sol；AI 辅助与视频剪辑：Codex。HTML 提供完整约3分39秒音乐关，视频约3分45秒，包含游戏演示与标准片尾。音乐以马里奥原作音效采样演绎 Bad Apple!! 旋律。片尾与封面字体：霞鹜文楷。角色、图像、音效、音乐与参考影像的权利归各自权利人所有。完整视频已在哔哩哔哩发布。": "Planning and production: 在下_小Q. Game creation: GPT-6.1 sol; AI assistance and video editing: Codex. The HTML offers the full 3-minute-39-second music course. The approximately 3-minute-45-second video includes gameplay and the standard outro. The Bad Apple!! melody is performed with original Mario sound-effect samples. Cover and outro font: LXGW WenKai. Rights to characters, art, sound effects, music and reference footage belong to their respective owners. The full video is available on Bilibili.",
    "马里奥在 Bad Apple!! 音乐关中奔跑，金币与砖块构成立体演出舞台。": "Mario runs through a Bad Apple!! rhythm course with coins and blocks forming a 3D performance stage.",
    "节奏跑酷音乐剧": "Rhythm platforming musical",
    "打开音乐关": "Play the music course",
    "新增完整音乐关、游戏源码与演示介绍：跟随节拍跳跃、下蹲和发射火球，后半段展开立体舞台。完整视频已在哔哩哔哩发布。": "Added a full music course, game source and demo introduction: jump, crouch and throw fireballs to the beat, then see the stage unfold into 3D. The full video is available on Bilibili.",
