    "下载后解压，用近期版本 Chrome 或 Edge 打开 play.html。离线下载为 0.8.14；本次修复请使用在线试玩。": "Extract the download and open play.html in a recent Chrome or Edge browser. The offline download is version 0.8.14; use Play Online for the latest fixes.",
    "穿过雨夜森林、乘矿车深入矿洞，在下界躲过恶魂，解开红石音符机关，再用三叉戟迎战末影龙。": "Cross a rainy forest, ride a minecart underground, dodge Ghasts in the Nether, solve a redstone note-block mechanism, and face the Ender Dragon with a trident.",
