    "马里奥与方块世界的冒险：矿车、下界与末影龙。": "Mario explores a block-built world of minecarts, the Nether and the Ender Dragon.",
    "混合马里奥在下_小Q版包含九位角色、经典关卡、角色专属隐藏关、彩蛋与成就。自制马里奥系列还包括五门挑战、午夜厨房潜行、Bad Apple!! 音乐小剧场，以及深入《我的世界》的方块冒险。": "Mario Mix · XiaoQ Edition includes nine heroes, classic stages, character-specific hidden stages, secrets and achievements. The custom Mario series adds a five-door challenge, a stealthy midnight kitchen, the Bad Apple!! music theater, and an adventure through Minecraft.",
    "从森林走向末地": "From the forest to the End",
    "马里奥从雨夜森林出发，乘矿车穿过矿洞，在下界应对恶魂，触发红石音符机关；最后使用三叉戟迎战末影龙，再回到村庄。": "Mario sets out through a rainy forest, rides a minecart through the caves, faces Ghasts in the Nether, and activates a redstone note-block mechanism. He then battles the Ender Dragon with a trident before returning to the village.",
