    "策划、试玩：在下_小Q。制图：dots；工具：马里奥地图工坊。本作含 AI 辅助制作内容。": "Planning and playtesting: 在下_小Q. Level design: dots. Tool: Mario Map Workshop. This work includes AI-assisted production.",
    "游戏字体：寒蝉点阵体。方块场景为程序绘制的像素改编画面。": "Game font: Chill Bitmap. The block-built environments are programmatically drawn pixel-art adaptations.",
