    "本作是非官方同人作品。角色、音乐与其他原作素材的权利归各自权利人所有。各素材适用的来源与许可说明见下载包；本工程没有统一的开源许可证，提供源码不代表获得原作素材授权。": "This is an unofficial fan work. Rights to characters, music and other original-game material belong to their respective owners. See the downloads for individual source and license information. The project has no single open-source license; source-code availability does not grant rights to original game assets.",
