    "下载地图工坊 2.0（1.11.0）": "Download Map Workshop 2.0 (1.11.0)",
    "安装 Node.js 22 或更新版本，运行 node server.mjs，打开终端给出的编辑器地址。普通编辑和试玩无需先安装 npm 依赖。": "Install Node.js 22 or newer, run node server.mjs, and open the editor address printed in the terminal. Basic editing and playtesting do not require installing npm dependencies first.",
