    "以撒带着眼泪闯进蘑菇王国。收集道具、叠加弹幕、凑齐套装，挑战四位 BOSS，再把满屏火力带到库巴面前。": "Isaac brings his tears to the Mushroom Kingdom. Collect items, combine projectiles, complete transformations and challenge four bosses before taking your full arsenal to Bowser.",
