    "下载后解压，用近期版本 Chrome 或 Edge 打开 play.html。在线与离线均为 0.9.13。": "Extract the download and open play.html in a recent version of Chrome or Edge. Both online and offline games are version 0.9.13.",
    "库巴，时代变了": "Bowser, Times Have Changed",
    "这次带来了什么": "What's new",
    "十位角色、32 个经典关卡。以撒新增四位 BOSS、六组套装与多种武器组合：从分裂泪弹，到硫磺火、妈刀和科技圆环，每次收集都能改变打法。": "Ten heroes and 32 classic stages. Isaac adds four bosses, six transformations and weapon synergies, from split tears to Brimstone, Mom’s Knife and Tech X rings. Every item can change how you play.",
    "隐藏管道通往 BOSS 战与特色房间。战斗之外，还能逛商店、开福袋、寻找隐藏奖励，把钥匙、炸弹和金币花在更合适的地方。": "Hidden pipes lead to boss fights and special rooms. Visit shops, open sacks and find secrets, putting keys, bombs and coins to use.",
    "支持键鼠、手柄与手机触屏，可切换经典画幅和宽屏。以撒支持自动连发与已拥有武器切换；点击道具图标可查看效果。": "Play with keyboard and mouse, a controller or touch controls. Choose classic or widescreen format. Isaac supports autofire and switching owned weapons; tap an item icon to see its effects.",
