    "游戏字体：寒蝉点阵体与原作位图字；视频字体：缝合像素字体、思源黑体、霞鹜文楷。宣传片使用程序编配音乐与游戏音效。": "Game fonts: Chill Bitmap and original bitmap lettering. Video fonts: Fusion Pixel, Source Han Sans and LXGW WenKai. The trailer uses program-arranged music and game sound effects.",
    "本作是非官方同人作品，原游戏角色、美术、音乐与音效的权利归各自权利人。网站源码包保留构建工具、运行素材与来源说明，不含历史回放工程和 Toy 音频母带。": "This is an unofficial fan project. Original characters, artwork, music and sound effects belong to their respective rights holders. The website source includes build tools, runtime assets and attribution; historical replay projects and Toy audio masters are excluded.",
    "以撒篇 · 视频": "Isaac episode · Video",
    "十位角色的混合冒险与独立自制关卡。以撒篇现已加入，试玩游戏，查看制作记录与源码。": "A crossover adventure with ten heroes, alongside original stages. The Isaac episode is here—play the games and explore development notes and source code.",
    "混合马里奥在下_小Q版包含十位角色、经典关卡、角色专属隐藏关、彩蛋与成就。以撒篇带来可叠加的武器、六组套装与四位 BOSS；自制马里奥系列还包括五门挑战、午夜厨房潜行、Bad Apple!! 音乐小剧场，以及深入《我的世界》的方块冒险。": "Xiao Q’s Mario Mix includes ten heroes, classic stages, character-specific hidden rooms, secrets and achievements. Isaac adds stacking weapons, six transformations and four bosses. The original Mario series also features five-region challenges, Midnight Kitchen stealth, Bad Apple!! music and a Minecraft adventure.",
    "以撒加入混合马里奥：收集道具、叠加弹幕、挑战四位 BOSS，再向库巴展示满装备的火力。": "Isaac joins Mario Mix: collect items, combine projectiles, challenge four bosses and show Bowser a fully equipped arsenal.",
    "以撒篇 0.9.13 上线：十位角色、32 个经典关卡，新增道具组合、六组套装与四位 BOSS。提供在线试玩、离线游戏和网站源码，宣传片已在 B 站发布。": "Isaac episode 0.9.13 is here: ten heroes, 32 classic stages, item synergies, six transformations and four bosses. Play online or download the offline game and website source. The trailer is now on Bilibili.",
