    "打开 HTML，可以暂停、调节视角，观察放映室里的光路与微镜；完整 MV 的阶段字幕、声音交接与竖屏片尾请在哔哩哔哩观看。原曲：Bad Apple!! feat. nomico / Alstroemeria Records；影绘原作：sm8628149。策划、审校：在下_小Q；视觉、程序与剪辑：GPT-6 · Codex。字体：思源黑体、霞鹜文楷。本片为非官方同人 MV，含 AI 辅助制作内容。音乐、角色及影像权益归相应权利人。": "Open the HTML to pause, adjust the view, and explore the light path and micromirrors in the screening room. Watch the complete MV on Bilibili for its section captions, audio transitions and portrait ending. Original song: Bad Apple!! feat. nomico / Alstroemeria Records; original silhouette video: sm8628149. Planning and review: Xiao Q; visuals, programming and editing: GPT-6 · Codex. Fonts: Source Han Sans and LXGW WenKai. This unofficial fan MV includes AI-assisted content. Music, character and footage rights belong to their respective holders.",
