    "以中秋文化为主题，保留完整画面与中文字幕，配乐为《彩云追月》。HTML 可直接播放最终成片。": "A Mid-Autumn cultural film with the complete picture, Chinese captions and Cai Yun Zhui Yue as its soundtrack. The HTML plays the finished film directly.",
    "提供彩云追月版 HTML、1080p 成片；B 站视频通过原 BV 号观看。": "The Cai Yun Zhui Yue HTML version and finished 1080p video are available. Watch the Bilibili video through its existing BV link.",
    "提供原生动画 HTML 与 1080p60 成片。": "The native HTML animation and finished 1080p60 video are available.",
    "播放器源码包暂不提供下载；配套视频和素材入口保留。XY 实验可直接载入完整作品，包括 Primer；其他作品首次载入需要联网下载和本机准备，之后复用缓存。完整素材页同时提供手动下载入口，所选媒体在本机处理。外观参考 Keysight UXR，为独立软件仿真。配套演示片长 2 分 02.37 秒，采用节选，Keil → Primer → Bad Apple 为最后三段；配套演示视频已在 B 站发布。策划、制作：在下_小Q；程序仿真、视频剪辑：GPT-6 Astra · Codex。": "The player source package is currently unavailable. Companion videos and media links remain available. The XY experiment can load complete works, including Primer. Other works require an internet connection and local preparation on first use, then reuse the cache. The complete media page also offers manual downloads; selected media are processed locally. This independent software simulation takes visual inspiration from Keysight UXR. The companion demonstration runs for 2 minutes 02.37 seconds and uses excerpts, ending with Keil, Primer and Bad Apple. The demonstration is published on Bilibili. Planning and production: Xiao Q; simulation programming and video editing: GPT-6 Astra · Codex.",
