    "小六：这是攻，这是防，这是苇名弦一郎。将小六与巨大旧钥匙带进《只狼：影逝二度》，体验熟悉战斗中的不同身影。": "Six: attack, defend, and face Genichiro Ashina. Bring Six and a giant old key into Sekiro: Shadows Die Twice for a new look at familiar battles.",
    "约2分49秒。游戏：《只狼：影逝二度》；试玩：在下_小Q；MOD制作：GPT-6 Astra / Codex；模型：Tripo。小六来自《小小梦魇》。本作为非官方同人MOD，游戏、角色及适配使用的原有骨架、材质和动作数据权利归各自权利人。完整实机视频已在哔哩哔哩发布。": "About 2 minutes 49 seconds. Game: Sekiro: Shadows Die Twice; gameplay: Aha_xiaoQ; mod: GPT-6 Astra / Codex; models: Tripo. Six originates from Little Nightmares. This is an unofficial fan mod; game, character and original skeleton, material and animation data rights remain with their owners. Watch the full gameplay video on Bilibili.",
    "适用于 Windows / Steam 版《只狼：影逝二度》。包含小六、巨大旧钥匙及配套动作适配。": "For Sekiro: Shadows Die Twice on Windows / Steam. Includes Six, the giant key and matching animation adjustments.",
    "退出游戏，解压 MOD，保留 six-key 下的 parts 与 chr 文件夹。": "Exit the game and extract the MOD. Keep both parts and chr folders inside six-key.",
    "下载官方 ME3 v0.13.0，并按安装说明设置 Steam 启动选项。": "Download official ME3 v0.13.0 and configure Steam launch options as described in the installation guide.",
    "从 Steam 启动游戏；取得楔丸后，武器外观会变为巨大旧钥匙。": "Launch through Steam. The giant key appears after obtaining Kusabimaru.",
    "需要自行拥有游戏。不含游戏本体、存档或加载器。停用时恢复原 Steam 启动选项；不要删除存档。同文件的角色、武器或动作 MOD 可能冲突。大幅动作可能仍有轻微衣物接触，不死斩与忍具伞未完整适配。": "Requires your own game. No game executable, saves or loader executable are bundled. Restore previous Steam launch options to disable; do not delete saves. Mods replacing the same character, weapon or animation files may conflict. Minor clipping may remain in extreme motions; the Mortal Blade and Loaded Umbrella are not fully adapted.",
    "Bad Apple!! 但是GPT手搓版": "Bad Apple!! — GPT handmade edition",
    "经典黑白影绘与彩色动画同屏对照，右上角的 Q 版角色随人物出场切换。": "Classic black-and-white silhouettes alongside color animation, with chibi characters changing in the top-right corner.",
    "同屏对照音乐 MV": "Side-by-side music video",
    "Bad Apple!! 封面：左侧是手持苹果的黑白剪影，右侧是红白巫女装的彩色灵梦，右上角是 Q 版灵梦。": "Bad Apple!! cover: black-and-white apple silhouette on the left, color Reimu on the right, and chibi Reimu at the top right.",
    "同一首 Bad Apple!!，两种画面一起看。左侧保留经典黑白影绘，右侧以彩色动画呈现人物与道具，Q 版角色在右上角接力登场。": "Two interpretations of Bad Apple!! side by side: classic silhouettes on the left, color character animation on the right, and chibi characters above.",
    "约3分40秒，横屏对照音乐 MV。通过图像生成与程序动画制作，右上角展示 Q 版动图。策划、审校：在下_小Q；图像、程序与视频制作：GPT Astra、Codex。原曲：Bad Apple!! feat. nomico / Alstroemeria Records；影绘原作：sm8628149。本片为东方 Project 非官方同人 MV，含 AI 生成内容。音乐、角色及参考影像权益归相应权利人所有。完整视频已在哔哩哔哩发布。": "About 3 minutes 40 seconds. Created with image generation and procedural animation, with chibi animations at the top right. Planning and review: Aha_xiaoQ; images, programming and video: GPT Astra and Codex. Music: Bad Apple!! feat. nomico / Alstroemeria Records; original silhouette video: sm8628149. Unofficial Touhou Project fan MV containing AI-generated content. Music, characters and reference footage belong to their respective owners. Full video on Bilibili.",
