    "观看 只狼MOD | 小六大战苇名弦一郎 视频（在新标签页打开）": "Watch Sekiro MOD | Six vs. Genichiro Ashina (opens in a new tab)",
    "黄色雨衣与巨大旧钥匙来到苇名城。观看小六挑战弦一郎，并下载配套角色与武器 MOD。 完整视频已在哔哩哔哩发布。": "A yellow raincoat and a giant old key arrive in Ashina. Watch Six challenge Genichiro and download the character and weapon mod. Full video on Bilibili.",
